 	  This enables support for HiSilicon v3xx SPI NOR flash controller
 	  found in hi16xx chipsets.
 
+config LUOFU_FMC
+	tristate "HiSilicon Luofu FMC SPI-NAND controller"
+	depends on ARCH_LUOFU || COMPILE_TEST
+	depends on MTD_SPI_NAND
+	help
+	  SPI-NAND flash controller of the HiSilicon Hi5671Y "luofu" SoC.
+	  The driver is a SPI-MEM controller; the flash chip itself is handled
+	  by the generic SPI-NAND stack.  The root filesystem of the board
+	  lives on this controller, so it must be built in (=y) there.
